{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"## Landed\n\nGerrit change 3208 merged as 74e333ef1d6 (2026-11-01 07:08 PST): LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 on patch set 2 (a13531cdd2c), 0 unresolved comments.\n\n**AC1 (source + hypotheses).** See the investigation comment: `transition_ticket` runs `rebar.transition` in-process on the same `REBAR_TRACKER_DIR` clone (hypothesis 1 refuted); the pinned view is off on the server (0 of 400 recent verdicts carry `completion_read_basis`), so the precheck reduced the clone's files directly (hypothesis 2 refuted as stated). Cause: nothing on the close path fetched; only throttled read tools did.\n\n**Fix.** `transition_close._refresh_close_material` calls `reads.ensure_fresh(tracker, force=True)` at the top of the close branch of `close_ticket`, before the open-child scan and outside the write lock; skipped for forced closes and `idea` rejections. Patch set 1 placed it after the open-child scan; the LLM-Review advisory noted the scan read stale state, so patch set 2 moved it ahead of the scan. `docs/concurrency.md` documents it in the gate-freshness and read-freshness sections.\n\n**AC2-AC4 (tests).** `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_fresh_ac_material.py`, two clones of one bare origin, B's throttle marker fresh, `verify_completion` stubbed (no LLM):\n- Before the fix: `2 failed, 3 passed` — `test_close_observes_boxes_ticked_in_another_clone` (refused with the stale `- [ ] first done / - [ ] second done`) and `test_close_refuses_a_box_unticked_in_another_clone` (closed on stale ticks).\n- After the fix: all 6 pass (adds the idea-rejection no-fetch test), plus `test_sync_pull_off_keeps_the_close_local` (0 fetches), `test_unreachable_origin_closes_on_local_state`, `test_forced_close_does_not_fetch`.\n\n**AC5.** Locally: `make lint` exit 0, `make typecheck` \"Success: no issues found in 746 source files\"; targeted runs 578 passed (tests/interfaces/lifecycle), 803 passed (modules referencing the close path / freshness), 451 passed 9 skipped (tests/interfaces/store), 1152 passed (close/transition/fresh/upkeep selection), integration tier 195 passed. Patch set 1 got Verified -1 from one policy test (`test_no_test_clones_an_unpinned_bare_repository`: the new test created its bare origin by hand); fixed with `init_bare_remote`. Patch set 2: Verified +1.\n\nNo live LLM gate run was used for reproduction. LLM gate runs in this session: 1 `review-plan` (PASS, signed) and the close's completion verification."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793545816285669001,"uuid":"18dcef89-04e1-4368-8a8d-34726aa0987b"}